{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\電撃雷訪.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "111" "CLICK"}
{MOTION "789" "111" "3" "960" "200" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-760\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-760\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "540" "100" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
"Everyone across the country! Good morning!
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\ユキピン.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
　Yukino Shinbashi here, and today I'm paying a visit to this place!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yuki-chan, that's a park with an awful lot of cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right! Actually, we're broadcasting from Central Park in Motoki-cho, Sawa Prefecture. 
{PAUSE ""}
Today we're bringing you the show from Motoki-cho, Sawa Prefecture, famous nationwide for its cherry blossoms!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Oh, the crowd's really fired up too!
{WAITPLAY "111" "CLICK"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n540\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
"Yes! Here in Central Park, the Motoki Cherry Blossom Festival is held for about a month every year, and this year it's reaching its 70th!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―So that means the festival has been going on since Shiyo 730!?
{PAUSE ""}
　That's quite a long history for a festival.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
"About that, actually, the very first festival ever held was already the 15th!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hm? What do you mean?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Please take a look at this!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園背景1gal.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Oh, that's a magnificent cherry tree!
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\4.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, this is the big cherry tree that's said to be the goshinboku, the symbol of Motoki-cho, you could say."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\5.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It looks like it's about 1,000 years old or something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Actually, this tree apparently hasn't even been growing for 70 years yet."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―What!? It's that young!?
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム1" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"That's right. 
{PAUSE ""}
The cherry-blossom festival originally started as a way to worship this goshinboku, but the residents back then had a question: 'Wasn't this cherry tree here much longer ago?' 
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\6.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
So, to make it a festival that had been held since much earlier, they deliberately called even the very first one the 15th."
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\7.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
―Even so, if it's been going on for more than 50 years, that means the people of Motoki-cho really do love their cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, among Motoki-cho residents, there are even companies with a system called cherry-blossom leave, rather than paid leave. 
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム1" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
So at this time of year, even on weekdays, it's as lively as a weekend."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I see! Are there any fun events?
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\8.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<PG>
"Actually, today is the spring eating contest, the main event of the Motoki Cherry Blossom Festival!
{PAUSE ""}
　And we've received word that a super-big-name special guest will be competing!"
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A special guest competing means... 
{PAUSE ""}
someone who can really eat, right?
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\9.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<PG>
"Yes! The winner of the recent national tournament... 
{PAUSE ""}
If you're curious, please come visit Motoki-cho!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Motoki-cho's a long way to go from here right now!
{PAUSE ""}
　What dish will they be competing with?
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム1" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"That would be... 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\焼きそば.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,222" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
this! A food-stall classic, sauce yakisoba!
{PAUSE ""}
　The contestant who eats the most of this sauce yakisoba in 15 minutes wins!"
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\10.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Oh, that looks delicious! For me, sauce yakisoba and grilled squid are must-haves!<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
"Of course, there's a grilled-squid stall too!
{PAUSE ""}
　Now, I'd like to try some of this yakisoba right away!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Ah, that's the classic style, the kind that makes you want a beer. 
{PAUSE ""}
Personally, I'd want mayonnaise on it.<PG>
"Mmm! Delicious!
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\11.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
　Yep, that slightly charred touch you only get at a stall, and the smell of the sauce hitting you hard, piping hot and fresh off the griddle, are the best!
{PAUSE ""}
　Actually, the winner of this contest since the year before last is said to be a little girl!"
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム1" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A little girl?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, last year she apparently polished off 150 takoyaki in 15 minutes!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―150!? I couldn't do that even if I had a week...
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr47\12.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "380" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"She's entering again this year, apparently, so will it be a one-on-one showdown with the special guest, or will a third force come storming in!? It's going to be a very exciting battle!
{PAUSE ""}
　Neighbors, people of Sawa Prefecture, please come out to Central Park in Motoki-cho today!
{PAUSE ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n460\r\n100\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "540" "100" "DEC" "WAIT"}
　That's all from the scene!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
―Thank you, Yuki-chaaan!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr1\0.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
